  "declaredSeams": [
    "Shared NativeScanHost owns actual CoreAppHost resolver discovery, concrete LibraryManager, real root/default/{library} .mblink discovery, actual Folder/global traversal, EF SQLite and native persistence. No traversal or provider response is synthesized.",
    "LibrarySeed writes actual CollectionFolder library options. SaveLocalMetadata and EnablePhotos are controlled input configuration, not ILibraryManager return-value proxies.",
    "BookPhotoProviders appends real native local providers/services and actual LocalImageProvider/ImageProcessor/Skia. Equal-priority local Book order follows retained actual CoreAppHost discovery evidence: Comic, EPUB, OPF.",
    "No Internet metadata providers, plugin downloads or hosted HTTP are installed in this first compound. Shared host must reject every outbound HTTP attempt. Network denial must not become a successful provider response.",
    "Shared S1 posttasks may be two declared sentinels. Their presence is not full posttask acceptance. Watcher/timers and startup tasks stay under shared-host explicit qualification.",
    "Input file bytes, names, timestamps and mutations are controlled only inside a fresh case media root. Media and internal metadata roots remain physically separate. Future candidate validation must map original media and metadata sidecars independently.",
    "Each host anchors media-copy/comic mtimes to its case-start UTC whole second, minus remaining scan steps times mediaMutationTimeStepSeconds. Replacements therefore exceed BaseItem.HasChanged's one-second threshold without sleeps or future mtimes. Actual filesystem timestamps are read back and recorded. Text/OPF/XML writes and DateLastSaved retain their real wall clocks.",
    "This preparation has no native output or acceptance counts. Fresh actual execution, full source/build closure, raw stdout/stderr/receipt, loaded assemblies, files and SQLite hashes must be bound later before candidate comparison."
  ],
